#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0504 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "CR504 scopes the rule to names ending in TM but not DTM (its Description since before PLAN-library-template-label-resolution): a DTM name has its own fragment and rule (*DTM, CDISC-AD0505), and 'Datetime' does not contain 'Time' as written. Round 1 retired the conjunct as structural under longest-suffix governance; round 2 (R2-3: each rule judges every name its suffix matches, label_template(\"LIBRARY\", stem=\"*TM\") answers '{Time}' for XDTM too) brings it back as the rule's own scope test. XDTM's label lacks 'Time' on purpose and stays unjudged here; XTM is the positive control: its label contains 'Time'."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *TM name=*TM label="{Time}"
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *DTM name=*DTM label="{Datetime}"
#expectViolationCount 0
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col XTM type=Char label="Analysis Time"
col XDTM type=Char label="Foo"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | x | y
---
